# GS25: from ml_sleet.sav (Sleet's room): Mia's Ply heals the party, back through the Upper and the Middle, the Exterior's west side, the Upper's waterfalls room, Move on the gap statue (31,20), the east path, the waterfall's riddle; walk into its statue (Ply's reach 16 px) and Ply: the waterfall stops, the party rises to the Lighthouse Aerie (the beacon already lit); the platforms, Ply heals; ends at 24,12 before the confrontation cell.
